{"resourceIdentifier":"4368","resourceName":"Waste to Energy Project in Chennai, Tamil Nadu","description":"The proposed project activity is an organic waste processing plant located at Plot No. A-2, S in Block No.0029, Survey No.465/4, 20, 30, Spur Tank Road, Egmore Taluk, Chennai, Tamil Nadu by Srinivas Waste Management Services Private Limited. The project activity involves anaerobic decomposition of degradable food and other organic waste and generate bioCNG and manure. This project is greenfield project activity with an installed capacity of 100 TPD. Required segregated food and other organic wastes would be sourced from bulk waste generators (BWG) like hotels, industries, fish/ vegetable markets, community hall, hospital Canteens and segregated waste from Apartments.","location":{"latitude":13.075136,"longitude":80.251277},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-15","endExclusive":"2023-09-15","endInclusive":"2023-09-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4368"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tamil Nadu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Srinivas Waste Management Services Private Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"TAMIL NADU, India"},{"type":"string","value":"9884422371"},{"type":"string","value":"nagz@swms.in"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28918"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"12/06/2024"}]},{"code":"